      "name": "Wrap in Shadow-Silk",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Mark a Stress to make an attack against a target within Melee range. On a success, the target is Vulnerable and Restrained until they succeed on a Strength Roll (10)."
    },
    {
      "name": "Shadow Fang",
      "kind": "Reaction",
      "rulesText": "When the Spinner makes a successful attack against a target within Melee range, you can spend a Fear to make the target Shaky until they succeed on an Instinct Roll (10). While Shaky, the target has disadvantage on attack rolls."
    }
